#!golden 1
#!case fw_disable_help
#!section exit
0
#!section stdout
disable [channel H] lun L netfn N [force]
\tdisable all commands on this LUN/NetFn pair
disable [channel H] lun L netfn N command C [force]
\tdisable Command C and all its Sub-functions for this LUN/NetFn pair
disable [channel H] lun L netfn N command C subfn S
\tdisable Sub-function S for Command C for this LUN/NetFn pair
* force will allow you to disable the "Command Set Enable" command
\tthereby letting you shoot yourself in the foot
\tthis is only recommended for advanced users
#!section stderr
#!section requests
> netfn=0x2c lun=0x00 cmd=0x00 target_cmd=0x00 data=00
< rule=default ccode=0xc1 len=0 data=
> netfn=0x2c lun=0x00 cmd=0x00 target_cmd=0x00 data=03
< rule=default ccode=0xc1 len=0 data=
bye
